eave in the ship to seek out other  eternals and try to stop the cycle of  destruction  cersei kingo and fasto stay on earth but  are then pulled into space by arishum  and vanish the plot leak then goes on to  talk about what the two post-credit  scenes could be  and according to this plot leak here's  what they are the first one  is dane looking at an old box and he  pulls out a sword that is wrapped up  just as he is about to touch it an  off-screen voice stops him  this is obviously a setup for him to  become his comic book character  the black knight and the sword that he  could be discovering is the ebony blade  a blade that had been carved from a  meteor and enchanted by the wizard  merlin it was originally made for the  first black knight sir percy of scandia  who is an ancestor of dane whitman's  the second post credit scene is on the  eternals ship  pip the troll appears and introduces  star fox  now for those of you who don't know star  fox is an eternal and is actually the  brother of  thanos thanos is actually an eternal he  was born of two eternal parents but he  inherited the deviant gene which is why  he is insanely strong  and since the eternals and deviants are  essentially immortal  i figured it was only a matter of time  until thanos's brother star fox actually  appeared  so that's the plot leak but there are a  few main points that we have to talk  about here  the one main point i want to talk about  which is the main point that i really  really don't like  is the fact that ajax dies and is  actually killed by icarus  to me i'm not sure this would make sense  icarus is a good guy in the comics and  one of his main  priorities in the comics is actually  looking after his eternal family so to  make him sort of a bad guy in this  i really don't like that especially the  fact that he would kill off ajak which  is salma hayek's character  it would be such a waste to have her in  the mcu for only a brief moment  now the problem here is that this league  talked about her settling  in a midwest ranch in which we just saw  in the trailer that that  is the case she was on a horse wearing a  cowboy hat  on a ranch and this leak came out a  while ago so this is  probably true which makes me pretty mad  that's a complete waste of salma hayek  but hopefully it could be wrong however  there are many parts of this plot leak  that are true  for example it says that sarsi and dane  whitman are teachers in the uk  and that they're dating and we've  actually seen leaked pictures of this  we've actually seen cersei and dane  whitman kissing  another part that is true is fastest  will live with his husband  and their child marvel studios has  already confirmed that one of the  eternals will be gay  specifically fast dose and as you can  see here in the plot league  that is another thing that's true and  then of course kingo being a bollywood  actor comes as no surprise kamil  nanjiani recently  opened up about how he had to learn this  whole dance sequence for the movie  so another true part and then last but  not least the druid is living in some  rainforest scene seems to be true  as well and this actually explains one  random scene that we got in the little  teaser where we see  most of the eternals together and in the  background are a bunch of people dressed  in white  it is actually kind of creepy but the  fact that druid has lost faith in  humanity and is wanting to control  humanity to stop  war and famine and etc this scene makes  sense  this could be the village that he's  living in and these people could be the  people that he's trying to control  so overall this plot leak seems fairly  accurate which kind of makes me mad  because i don't want ajax to die within  the first couple minutes of the movie  and i also don't want icarus to be bad  so it is possible that  some parts are right of this plot leak  and maybe some other parts aren't but  that could just be wishful thinking on  my part  but let me know what you think about  this in the comments down below what  would you think of this  eternals story plot would you enjoy this  or does this make you mad as well  let me know your thoughts in the  comments down below don't forget to  subscribe to stay up to date on all of  the latest mcu news  don't forget to like the video and for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof  you

